  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\text { Hints : } \\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2+\\sqrt{2+\\sqrt{2.2 \\cos ^2 2 x}}}}=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2+\\sqrt{2+2 \\cos 2 x}}}=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2+\\sqrt{2.2 \\cos ^2 x}}} \\\\\n& =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2+2 \\cos x}}=\\frac{2}{2 \\cos \\frac{x}{2}}=\\sec \\frac{x}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
